# Phaser / React

- Dual panel: `DungeonScene` (pixel art) + `TerminalPanel` (IBM Plex Mono). Do not merge them. Pre-run lobby is React (`src/lobby/Lobby.tsx`), not a second Phaser dungeon.
- Sprite sheet `/assets/kenney/tiny-dungeon/tilemap_packed.png`: 16×16, 12 columns, spacing 0. Use UX.md keys (`seat_guardian`, `door`, `lobby_gate`, `gem_complete`, …). `pixelArt: true`.
- Map SFX `/assets/kenney/sfx/`: named keys in UX.md (`sfx_door_open`, `sfx_room_enter`, `sfx_quest_complete`, `sfx_chest_open`). Music beds `/assets/kenney/music/`: `bgm_lobby`, `bgm_dungeon`. No TTS.
- REST lives in `src/api/client.ts`. Match engine camelCase session fields. Proxy `/api` and `/ws` only. Session restore uses `POST /api/sessions/import`. Leave/delete use `DELETE /api/sessions/{id}/party` and `DELETE /api/sessions/{id}`.
- Quality: Prettier + ESLint + Vitest coverage (`npm run verify`). Phaser canvas (`src/game`) is excluded from coverage.
- Seats are cosmetic. Submit commands as typed; do not filter by `seatId`.
- No Web Speech, no `child_process`, no `oc` from the browser. Keep the CRT look in CSS, readable type in the log.
